================================================================================
COMPREHENSIVE PAPER METRICS - PBScaler Evaluation
================================================================================

## EXPERIMENT SETUP
- MAX_REQUESTS=7600, USER_POOL=560, TRACE_COMPRESS=8
- HPA baseline: 43 HPAs (CPU 80%, min 1, max 10)
- PBScaler: v1.2.4 with RF trained on Run 1' (clean HPA-only data)
- All runs: 6h collection + 30min warmup

