## RF PREDICTOR METRICS (Table IV from paper)
Train dataset: Run 1' (HPA-only, Jul-13, 4320 rows, 25.4% violations)
- Test accuracy: 0.951
- Test recall: 0.888 (violation detection)
- Test precision: 0.918
- AUC: 0.930
- F1-score: 0.902 (violation class)

## PBSCALER BEHAVIORAL ANALYSIS
=== Scaling Decisions (top services by frequency) ===
- ts-voucher-service: 57 decisions (mostly to 1)
- ts-user-service: 57 decisions (mostly to 1)
- ts-travel2-service: 57 decisions (mostly to 9)
- ts-ui-dashboard: 55 decisions (mostly to 9)
- ts-travel-service: 55 decisions (mostly to 9)
- ts-station-service: 55 decisions (mostly to 9)

=== Per-Service Replica Analysis (max/median/mean) ===
- Most services scale to 9 replicas under load
- Low-traffic services (voucher, user, notification) stay at 1
- Hot-path services (travel, ui, contacts) consistently at 9

