## COMPARISON: PBScaler vs HPA (Jul-14 runs)
- HPA violation rate: 49.46%
- PBScaler violation rate: 42.08%
- PBScaler improvement: 7.38% reduction
- HPA P90 median: 189.7 ms
- PBScaler P90 median: 46.5 ms
- PBScaler P90 improvement: 143.2 ms

## DATA QUALITY NOTES
- Run 1' (Jul-13): 1 gaps (healthy)
- Run 3 (Jul-14 HPA): 126 gaps (Mimir blips)
- Run 2' (Jul-14 PBScaler): 986 gaps (disk pressure event)
- Max P90 in Run 2' is 853s (artifact from disk pressure event)
